{"applicability_conditions":"由公式(4)取自然对数得到；文中拟合结果在 1050 °C 和 0.01 s⁻¹ 条件下给出，该材料常数 C 也可在其他 T 和 ε̇ 条件下获得。","identity":{"block_id":"b0044","equation_id":"equation_005","equation_number":"5","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\ln \\left(\\frac {\\sigma}{\\sigma_ {\\mathrm{p}}}\\right) = C \\left[ \\ln \\left(\\frac {\\varepsilon}{\\varepsilon_ {\\mathrm{p}}}\\right) + 1 - \\frac {\\varepsilon}{\\varepsilon_ {\\mathrm{p}}} \\right]\\tag{5}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.jmrt.2021.08.079"},"latex":"\\ln \\left(\\frac {\\sigma}{\\sigma_ {\\mathrm{p}}}\\right) = C \\left[ \\ln \\left(\\frac {\\varepsilon}{\\varepsilon_ {\\mathrm{p}}}\\right) + 1 - \\frac {\\varepsilon}{\\varepsilon_ {\\mathrm{p}}} \\right]","purpose":"公式(4)两边取自然对数后得到的线性化形式，用于通过拟合 ln(σ/σ_p) 对 [ln(ε/ε_p)+1-ε/ε_p] 的斜率来计算材料常数 C。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"流变应力 (应力)","symbol":"\\sigma","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"峰值应力","symbol":"\\sigma_{\\mathrm{p}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"应变","symbol":"\\varepsilon","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"峰值应变","symbol":"\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{p}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"材料常数","symbol":"C","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["公式(5)表明 C 可由 ln(σ/σ_p) 对 [ln(ε/ε_p)+1-ε/ε_p] 的拟合斜率计算得到。","该式为公式(4)取自然对数的结果。"]}